  "description": "🍞 A cozy collection of modern cottagecore kitchen watercolor clipart featuring charming cookware, handmade ceramics, baking essentials, fresh ingredients, and beautifully styled kitchen accessories. Created in a soft commercial watercolor style with simplified organic shapes, gentle painterly details, and warm natural colors, this collection captures the inviting atmosphere of a modern cottagecore kitchen with clean, uncluttered compositions and timeless everyday objects.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on Demand products\n• Stickers and sticker sheets\n• Scrapbooking projects\n• Journals and planners\n• Greeting cards and stationery\n• Recipe books and kitchen planners\n• Social media graphics\n• Digital and printable crafts\n• Cottagecore home décor projects\n• Kitchen-themed merchandise\n🤎 What’s included:\n– 20 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 20 SVG files\n🍯 Included illustrations:\nfloral stovetop kettle, cottage refrigerator, cozy kitchen stove, stoneware teapot, tea mug with spoon, homemade strawberry jam jar, floral ceramic plate with cookies, wooden kitchen shelf, enamel Dutch oven, garlic harvest, butter and bread board, ceramic utensil crock, fresh herb bundle, olive oil bottle, ceramic mixing bowl with dough, woven bread basket, baking ingredients, cottage sink corner, fresh produce bowl, open recipe book etc.\n🌿 Inspired by modern cottagecore interiors, cozy home kitchens, handmade pottery, enamel cookware, rustic baking, fresh herbs, artisan bread, homemade preserves, natural wood, soft linen textiles, warm ceramics, slow living, seasonal cooking, farmhouse-inspired kitchens, and simple everyday rituals. These illustrations are perfect for creating warm, inviting, and timeless kitchen-themed designs with a fresh modern cottagecore aesthetic.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>🍞 A cozy collection of modern cottagecore kitchen watercolor clipart featuring charming cookware, handmade ceramics, baking essentials, fresh ingredients, and beautifully styled kitchen accessories. Created in a soft commercial watercolor style with simplified organic shapes, gentle painterly details, and warm natural colors, this collection captures the inviting atmosphere of a modern cottagecore kitchen with clean, uncluttered compositions and timeless everyday objects.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:<br>\n• Print on Demand products<br>\n• Stickers and sticker sheets<br>\n• Scrapbooking projects<br>\n• Journals and planners<br>\n• Greeting cards and stationery<br>\n• Recipe books and kitchen planners<br>\n• Social media graphics<br>\n• Digital and printable crafts<br>\n• Cottagecore home décor projects<br>\n• Kitchen-themed merchandise</p>\n<p>🤎 What’s included:<br>\n– 20 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 20 SVG files</p>\n<p>🍯 Included illustrations:</p>\n<p>floral stovetop kettle, cottage refrigerator, cozy kitchen stove, stoneware teapot, tea mug with spoon, homemade strawberry jam jar, floral ceramic plate with cookies, wooden kitchen shelf, enamel Dutch oven, garlic harvest, butter and bread board, ceramic utensil crock, fresh herb bundle, olive oil bottle, ceramic mixing bowl with dough, woven bread basket, baking ingredients, cottage sink corner, fresh produce bowl, open recipe book etc.</p>\n<p>🌿 Inspired by modern cottagecore interiors, cozy home kitchens, handmade pottery, enamel cookware, rustic baking, fresh herbs, artisan bread, homemade preserves, natural wood, soft linen textiles, warm ceramics, slow living, seasonal cooking, farmhouse-inspired kitchens, and simple everyday rituals. These illustrations are perfect for creating warm, inviting, and timeless kitchen-themed designs with a fresh modern cottagecore aesthetic.</p>",
